    "description": {
      "type": "String",
      "label": "Description",
      "value": "<p>You take your foe’s blade to the back of your neck, not deep enough for serious spinal damage but still leaving your noggin’ less attached than previously.</p><p><strong>Effects:</strong> Gain @Condition[Bleeding] (2). Also suffer a @UUID[Compendium.wfrp4e-core.items.Item.eWPN3CV2Eddwz8aM]{Torn Muscle (Major)} which will affect all physical actions and Tests until your neck muscles have knitted back together well enough to stabilize your head.</p>"
